WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Illustrative demo — a durable agent control plane for reviewable delivery.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Write the change and inspect the provider route and estimated usage before execution.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Review the task list, token estimate, and cap before approving any coding work.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Follow tool actions, validation, token usage, and spend while the agents work.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Inspect the final score, build and test signals, reviewer result, and provider ledger.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:54.000
The generated pull request carries its validation evidence for human review.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.200
Review the evidence attached to the pull request and decide whether to merge.
